{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/tuningsystem\/neidhardtiii"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"neidhardtIII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three fifths — C→G, G→D, D→A — are each narrowed by ⅙ of the Pythagorean comma"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(≈ 698.045 cents). Six fifths — A→E, B→F♯, F♯→C♯, C♯→A♭, E♭→B♭, B♭→F — are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each narrowed by 1\/12 of the Pythagorean comma (≈ 700.000 cents). The remaining"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three fifths — E→B, A♭→E♭, F→C — are pure. The circle closes exactly:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3×(1\/6) + 6×(1\/12) = 1 Pythagorean comma."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sectio Canonis Harmonici"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" (Königsberg, 1724). Differs from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem\/neidhardtII"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only in the placement of the sixth-comma group on the flat side: E♭→B♭ is tempered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here where it is pure in Neidhardt II, and F→C is pure here where it is tempered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Neidhardt II."}]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem\/neidhardtIII"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"role":"symbol","title":"neidhardtIII","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"neidhardtIII"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament"}],"extendedModule":"IvorTuning","roleHeading":"Type Property","externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE12neidhardtIIIAEvpZ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Neidhardt III (“Large City”; Johann Georg Neidhardt, 1724)."}],"references":{"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/TuningSystem/neidhardtIII":{"abstract":[{"text":"Neidhardt III (“Large City”; Johann Georg Neidhardt, 1724).","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem\/neidhardtIII","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"neidhardtIII"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":