type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"title":"WellTemperament"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/TuningSystem":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/tuningsystem","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"TuningSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TuningSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a musical tuning system."}],"title":"TuningSystem"}}}